    "id": "bx1-chapter-end-1-t-1",
    "category": "拓展与思考",
    "answer": "1. 设 $a = {3m} + {r}_{1}, b = {3n} + {r}_{2}, m\\text{、}n \\in  \\mathbf{Z},{r}_{1}\\text{、}{r}_{2} \\in  \\{ 0,1,2\\}$ .\n\n${ab} - 1 = \\left( {{3m} + {r}_{1}}\\right) \\left( {{3n} + {r}_{2}}\\right)  - 1 = {9mn} + {3m}{r}_{2} + {3n}{r}_{1} + {r}_{1}{r}_{2} - 1 = 3\\left( {{3mn} + m{r}_{2} + n{r}_{1}}\\right) \\; + \\left( {{r}_{1}{r}_{2} - 1}\\right)$ ,故 ${ab} - 1$ 是 3 的倍数,当且仅当 ${r}_{1}{r}_{2} - 1$ 是 3 的倍数.\n\n假设 ${r}_{1} \\neq  {r}_{2}$ ,不妨设 ${r}_{1} < {r}_{2}$ ,那么只有 $\\left\\{  \\begin{array}{l} {r}_{1} = 0,\\left\\{  {{r}_{1} = 0,\\left\\{  {{r}_{1} = 1,}\\right. }\\right. \\\\  {r}_{2} = 1;\\left\\{  {{r}_{2} = 2;\\left\\{  {{r}_{2} = 2}\\right. }\\right.  \\end{array}\\right.$ 这三种情况,此时 ${r}_{1}{r}_{2} - 1$ 分别为 $- 1\\text{、} - 1\\text{、}1$ ,都不是 3 的倍数,这与 ${ab} - 1$ 是 3 的倍数矛盾. 因此假设不成立,故 ${r}_{1} = {r}_{2}$ ,即 $a$ 与 $b$ 被 3 除的余数相同.",
